            "review_title": "Review at Gold Ship Craft Beer & Bistro",
            "review_text": "Tom S\n8 contributions\n0\nHidden gem in HCMC\nSep 2026 • Couples\nI've only been here twice but it will become a new regular of mine. Great, accommodating staff can't speak highly enough of them. Attentive and helpful. The draft beer is excellent, varied and a very fair price. I tried the larger, pale ale, Irish stout and cider. All we're excellent. Only tried some food but what we tried was very tasty and the menu is varied for Asian an Western cuisine.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 25, 2026",
            "rating": 5.0,
